        "TileImage": "$($repository 856b2aa2-e224-48c3-b890-01fdf4dba6de).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning,\r\rToday&apos;s assignment brings you to Whittleton Creek. Our client has recently discovered that the disappearance of her older brother had been due to none other than Helen West, a muffin entrepreneur moonlighting as a serial killer.\r\rShe requests you eliminate the target using the same blueberry muffins Helen has baked, as comeuppance rightly served.\r\rAs for her other muffin cohorts? Well, do with them as you will. Just don&apos;t get caught on camera.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
